Q83618 | power | deccan | The Maratha Empire, or Maratha Confederacy, was an early modern polity in the Indian subcontinent, dated from Shivaji's coronation in 1674. | Shivaji was crowned king of the Marathas in 1674. His kingdom grew into an empire.
Q2209873 | religion | bhutan | Paro Taktsang is a sacred Buddhist site on the cliffside of the upper Paro valley in Bhutan, one of the Tiger's Nest caves linked to Padmasambhava. The monastery complex was built in 1692. | Paro Taktsang, the Tiger's Nest, is a Buddhist monastery built on a cliff in Bhutan in 1692.
